0%.

brief anomaly:
0%.

PRIMARY OVERRIDE NEGATIVE
A coarse model can achieve:
very high aggregate accuracy

while:
being:
completely blind
to:
real local exception.

Thus:

GLOBAL ACCURACY
DOES NOT PROVE
LOCAL MODEL FIT.

