PRIMARY BOTTOM-UP RESULT
Local sensing:
sees:
both normal
and
anomalous context

with:
its native sensor accuracy.

But:
it discards:
the strong denoising value
of:
a mostly correct coarse prior.

STATIC FUSION

overall:
