0.31%.

mean persistent-override latency:
12.70 steps.

false override openings:
approximately:
3.54
per complete 16-cell / 1,000-step stream.

PRIMARY POSITIVE
The coarse model remains:
highly useful

for:
ordinary cells.

But:
persistent local evidence
can:
remove
its execution authority
at:
one location.

This yields:
higher overall accuracy
than:
every tested comparator.

TOP-DOWN STATE IS NOT ERASED
A local contradiction does NOT:
delete:
the regional/global context model.

It only suppresses:
its authority
for:
the contradictory cell.

When:
the local region returns
to:
the global mode,

coarse authority:
can be restored.

This is:
the perceptual analogue
of:
H6,
H25,
H79,
H74.

